## Realtime Chat Architecture
- Channel per room
- Optimistic send + retry queue
- Load latest N messages, paginate older
- Attachment flow:
  1. Request presigned URL
  2. Upload to S3
  3. Save message row with attachment metadata

## GPS Adaptive Tracking
- Moving (>1.5 km/h): continuous/high frequency (10-30s)
- Stationary: 30-minute interval
- Shift ended: low-frequency heartbeat
- User pause/resume tracking supported with audit log

## Offline Sync Design
- Persisted query cache
- Local mutation queue for writes
- Sync on connectivity restore
- Conflict rules:
  - Draft writes: client last-write-wins
  - Approved records: server authority

## Notification Architecture
- Push + in-app inbox + badge model
- Deep-link payload to target screen
- Dedup/idempotency keys
- Quiet hours + digest preferences
- Include expense events: submitted, approved, rejected, paid

## Security & Compliance
- RLS on all new tables
- Server-side role checks on admin APIs
- Signed URLs for media access
- Data retention jobs (chat/location)
- Consent-required GPS and audio features
- Expense receipt files restricted to claimant + finance/admin scopes

## Observability
- API latency/error metrics
- Realtime message delivery metrics
- Offline queue depth and flush success
- Notification delivery/open/action metrics
- Location ingestion success and anomaly metrics

## Deployment Topology
- Mobile PWA: Expo web build
- Admin/API: Next.js deploy
- Supabase managed services
- S3 bucket with strict IAM + lifecycle policies

